{"timestamp":1774481027106,"source_app":"agentic-harness","session_id":"1e02c489-d9c2-4b3c-aaaf-ef1afdac5525","hook_event_type":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Write","tool_use_id":"toolu_01MiPHshoWQUNa76MASuxQjc","payload":{"session_id":"1e02c489-d9c2-4b3c-aaaf-ef1afdac5525","transcript_path":"/Users/rivero/.claude/projects/-Users-rivero-ai-agentic-experience-apps-mas-trees-3cfb10ef-mas/1e02c489-d9c2-4b3c-aaaf-ef1afdac5525.jsonl","cwd":"/Users/rivero/ai/agentic-experience/apps/mas/trees/3cfb10ef/mas","permission_mode":"bypassPermissions","hook_event_name":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"/Users/rivero/ai/agentic-experience/apps/mas/trees/3cfb10ef/mas/specs/issue-3cfb10ef-adw-3-sdlc_planner-fix-catalog-aria-roles.md","content":"# Plan: Fix Accessibility ARIA Roles on Catalog Page\n\n## Bug Description\n\nThree axe accessibility violations on `/products/catalog.html`:\n\n1. **`aria-required-children`** \u2014 Elements with an ARIA role must contain required child roles. The card collection container is missing `role=\"list\"` and the `merch-card[variant=\"catalog\"]` elements are missing `role=\"listitem\"`, breaking the required list/listitem hierarchy.\n\n2. **`aria-required-parent`** \u2014 Elements with an ARIA role must be contained by required parent roles. Same root cause as above: `merch-card[variant=\"catalog\"]` elements lack `role=\"listitem\"` and are not inside a `role=\"list\"` container.\n\n3. **Special Offers link missing `aria-label`** \u2014 The `sp-sidenav-item` for Special Offers in the Resources section has no `aria-label`. Screen readers cannot identify the link target.\n\n## Root Cause\n\n- `MerchCard` (`merch-card.js`) does not set `role=\"listitem\"` on the host element for the `catalog` variant.\n- `MerchCardCollection` (`merch-card-collection.js`) does not set `role=\"list\"` on its host element when displaying catalog cards.\n- The `sp-sidenav-item` for Special Offers in `catalog-sidenav.test.html` is missing `target=\"_blank\"` and `aria-label` attributes.\n\n## Relevant Files\n\n| File | Action |\n|------|--------|\n| `web-components/src/merch-card.js` | Add `role=\"listitem\"` to host element for `catalog` variant in `connectedCallback` and `willUpdate` |\n| `web-components/src/merch-card-collection.js` | Add `role=\"list\"` to the `merch-card-collection` host element for catalog variant |\n| `web-components/test/sidenav/catalog-sidenav.test.html` | Add `target=\"_blank\"` and `aria-label` to the Special Offers `sp-sidenav-item` |\n\n## Step by Step Tasks\n\n### 1. Add `role=\"listitem\"` to `merch-card` for catalog variant\n\n**File:** `web-components/src/merch-card.js`\n\n- In `connectedCallback()`, after the existing setup, add:\n  ```js\n  if (this.variant === 'catalog') {\n      this.setAttribute('role', 'listitem');\n  }\n  ```\n- In `willUpdate(changedProperties)`, after handling variant/variantLayout changes, add:\n  ```js\n  if (changedProperties.has('variant')) {\n      if (this.variant === 'catalog') {\n          this.setAttribute('role', 'listitem');\n      } else {\n          this.removeAttribute('role');\n      }\n  }\n  ```\n\n### 2. Add `role=\"list\"` to `merch-card-collection` for catalog variant\n\n**File:** `web-components/src/merch-card-collection.js`\n\n- In the `MerchCardCollection` `connectedCallback()`, set `role=\"list\"` when the collection's variant is `catalog`. Find where `variant` is consumed and add:\n  ```js\n  if (this.variant === 'catalog') {\n      this.setAttribute('role', 'list');\n  }\n  ```\n- In `willUpdate(changedProperties)` (or `updated()`), react to `variant` changes:\n  ```js\n  if (changedProperties.has('variant')) {\n      if (this.variant === 'catalog') {\n          this.setAttribute('role', 'list');\n      } else {\n          this.removeAttribute('role');\n      }\n  }\n  ```\n\n### 3. Fix Special Offers link `aria-label` in catalog sidenav\n\n**File:** `web-components/test/sidenav/catalog-sidenav.test.html`\n\n- Locate the `sp-sidenav-item` for Special Offers in the Resources section (line ~96):\n  ```html\n  <sp-sidenav-item href=\"/products/special-offers.html\">\n  ```\n- Add `target=\"_blank\"` and `aria-label` following the Milo pattern:\n  ```html\n  <sp-sidenav-item\n      href=\"/products/special-offers.html\"\n      target=\"_blank\"\n      aria-label=\"Open the Special Offers page in a new tab\">\n  ```\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `merch-card[variant=\"catalog\"]` elements have `role=\"listitem\"` on the host element\n- [ ] The `merch-card-collection` container for catalog variant has `role=\"list\"` on the host element\n- [ ] `aria-required-children` and `aria-required-parent` axe violations are resolved\n- [ ] Special Offers `sp-sidenav-item` has `aria-label=\"Open the Special Offers page in a new tab\"` and `target=\"_blank\"`\n- [ ] No regressions in existing catalog tests (`merch-card.catalog.test.html.js`)\n\n## Validation Commands\n\n```bash\nnode --check web-components/src/merch-card.js\nnode --check web-components/src/merch-card-collection.js\n```\n"},"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MiPHshoWQUNa76MASuxQjc"}}
